config QUANTUM_NET_DEV
	tristate "Emulated QNIC device /dev/qnet0"
	default y
	depends on QUANTUM_NET
	help
	  One misc device /dev/qnet0 exposing the quantum networking
	  substrate: link add/del, Bell-pair distribution, entanglement
	  swapping and teleportation counters. Built on the
	  arch/quantum mesh orchestration model (quantum-net.c). The
	  QNIC hardware abstraction (qnic.c) auto-negotiates a default
	  mesh on probe.
